ustomer support work.\n","- Improve customer service accessibility.\n","- Create a simple and interactive chatbot interface.\n","\n","3. Technologies Used\n","\n","- Python – Programming language.\n","- Google Colab – Coding environment.\n","- Gradio – User interface.\n","- Rule-based keyword matching – Response generation.\n","\n","4. Features\n","\n","- Order tracking assistance.\n","- Delivery information.\n","- Refund and return information.\n","- Exchange and cancellation assistance.\n","- Payment information.\n","- Customer support timings.\n","- Interactive web interface.\n","\n","5. Working Methodology\n","\n","The chatbot receives a user's message, checks it for predefined keywords and returns the corresponding response. If no keyword matches, it displays a default message.\n","\n","6. Limitations\n","\n","- It does not understand complex natural language.\n","- It uses predefined responses.\n","- It cannot access real order databases.\n","- It does not process actual refunds or cancellations.\n","\n","7. Future Scope\n","\n","- Integration with AI and Natural Language Processing.\n","- Real-time order tracking.\n","- Database connectivity.\n","- Multilingual support.\n","- Improved customer query understanding.\n","\n","8. Conclusion\n","\n","The project demonstrates how Python and Gradio can be used to develop a simple interactive customer service chatbot."],"metadata":{"id":"uz-gnNlBLQBE"}},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["# Customer Service Chatbot 🤖\n","\n","## About the Project\n","A rule-based customer service chatbot developed using Python and Gradio.\n","\n","## Features\n","- Order tracking assistance\n","- Delivery information\n","- Refund and return queries\n","- Exchange and cancellation assistance\n","- Payment information\n","- Customer support timings\n","- Interactive chat interface\n","\n","## Technologies\n","- Python\n","- Google Colab\n","- Gradio\n","\n","## How It Works\n","The chatbot identifies predefined keywords in customer messages and provides relevant responses.\n","\n","## Project Type\n","Beginner AI Internship Project\n","\n","## Version\n","2.0"],"metadata":{"id":"reMKuGNNMD_j"}}]}